public static class RelayProcessRunner{
 static string Drain(StreamReader stream,Action<string> line){var text=new StringBuilder();char[] buffer=new char[4096];int count;var pending=new StringBuilder();while((count=stream.Read(buffer,0,buffer.Length))>0){int keep=Math.Min(count,16384-text.Length);if(keep>0)text.Append(buffer,0,keep);if(line!=null){for(int i=0;i<count;i++){char value=buffer[i];if(value=='\n'){line(pending.ToString().TrimEnd('\r'));pending.Clear();}else if(pending.Length<4096)pending.Append(value);}}}if(line!=null&&pending.Length>0)line(pending.ToString());return text.ToString();}
 public static RelayProcessResult Run(ProcessStartInfo info,int seconds){return RunStreaming(info,seconds,null,null,false);}
 public static RelayProcessResult RunIndependent(ProcessStartInfo info,int seconds){return RunStreaming(info,seconds,null,null,true,true);}
 public static RelayProcessResult RunStreaming(ProcessStartInfo info,int seconds,Action<string> outputLine,Action<string> errorLine,bool independent,bool discardOutput=false){using(var process=new SetupChild(info,discardOutput)){using(var job=independent?null:new SetupJob()){process.Resume(job);var output=Task.Factory.StartNew(()=>Drain(process.Output,outputLine));var error=Task.Factory.StartNew(()=>Drain(process.Error,errorLine));if(!process.Wait(seconds*1000)){if(job!=null)job.StopAndDrain();else process.StopParent();throw new Exception(independent?"Unconfirmed setup cleanup. Launcher timed out; inspect Relay's status before retrying.":"A setup component timed out and its process group was stopped. Check internet access and retry.");}if(job!=null)job.StopAndDrain();if(!Task.WaitAll(new Task[]{output,error},10000))throw new Exception("Unconfirmed setup cleanup. Output streams did not close.");return new RelayProcessResult{ExitCode=process.ExitCode,Output=output.Result,Error=error.Result};}}}
}
internal sealed class SetupRunner {
 public event Action<string> Progress; public bool Publishing; public string LastNotice=""; public string Work;
 public static string Quote(string text){if(text.IndexOfAny(new[]{'"','\r','\n','\0'})>=0)throw new Exception("Invalid setup path.");return "\""+text.TrimEnd('\\')+"\"";}
 static void Resource(string name,string target){using(var input=Assembly.GetExecutingAssembly().GetManifestResourceStream(name)){if(input==null)throw new Exception("The setup download is incomplete.");using(var output=new FileStream(target,FileMode.CreateNew,FileAccess.Write,FileShare.None))input.CopyTo(output);}}
 public string Run(Options options){bool uncertain=false;try{return RunCore(options);}catch(Exception error){uncertain=error.Message.IndexOf("Unconfirmed setup cleanup",StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)>=0;throw;}finally{if(!uncertain)ClearWork();}}
 void ClearWork(){try{string parent=Path.Combine(Environment.GetFolderPath(Environment.SpecialFolder.LocalApplicationData),"Temp");if(Work==null||!String.Equals(Path.GetDirectoryName(Work),parent,StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)||!Path.GetFileName(Work).StartsWith("RelaySetup-",StringComparison.Ordinal)||!Directory.Exists(Work))return;foreach(string entry in Directory.GetFileSystemEntries(Work)){if((File.GetAttributes(entry)&FileAttributes.ReparsePoint)!=0)return;}Directory.Delete(Work,true);}catch{}}
 string RunCore(Options options){
  Work=Path.Combine(Environment.GetFolderPath(Environment.SpecialFolder.LocalApplicationData),"Temp","RelaySetup-"+Guid.NewGuid().ToString("N"));Directory.CreateDirectory(Work);
  Resource("Relay.Engine.ps1",Path.Combine(Work,"engine.ps1"));File.Copy(Application.ExecutablePath,Path.Combine(Work,"RelaySetup.exe"),false);if(options.Mode=="install"){Resource("Relay.Payload.zip",Path.Combine(Work,"payload.zip"));Resource("Relay.Manifest.json",Path.Combine(Work,"payload-manifest.json"));}
  var arguments=new StringBuilder("-NoLogo -NoProfile -NonInteractive -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File "+Quote(Path.Combine(Work,"engine.ps1"))+" -Mode "+options.Mode+" -BundleDirectory "+Quote(Work)+" -Destination "+Quote(options.Destination)+" -DataRoot "+Quote(options.Data)+" -Port "+options.Port);
  if(options.NoIntegrations)arguments.Append(" -NoIntegrations");if(options.AutoStart)arguments.Append(" -AutoStart");if(options.NoBrowser)arguments.Append(" -NoBrowser");if(options.BrowserCache.Length>0)arguments.Append(" -BrowserCache "+Quote(options.BrowserCache));
  var start=new ProcessStartInfo(Path.Combine(Environment.GetFolderPath(Environment.SpecialFolder.Windows),"System32","WindowsPowerShell","v1.0","powershell.exe"),arguments.ToString()){UseShellExecute=false,CreateNoWindow=true,RedirectStandardOutput=true,RedirectStandardError=true,WorkingDirectory=Work,StandardOutputEncoding=Encoding.UTF8,StandardErrorEncoding=Encoding.UTF8};
  start.EnvironmentVariables.Remove("NODE_OPTIONS");start.EnvironmentVariables.Remove("NODE_PATH");start.EnvironmentVariables.Remove("PSModulePath");
  string outcome=null,friendlyError=null;
  Action<string> output=line=>{if(line.StartsWith("PHASE|")){string message=line.Substring(6);if(message=="Publishing installation"||message.StartsWith("Removing application"))Publishing=true;if(Progress!=null)Progress(message);}else if(line.StartsWith("ERROR|"))friendlyError=line.Substring(6);else if(line.StartsWith("NOTICE|"))LastNotice=line.Substring(7);else if(line.StartsWith("READY|")||line.StartsWith("EXISTING|")||line.StartsWith("OPENED|")||line.StartsWith("REMOVED|"))outcome=line.Split('|')[0];};
  var result=RelayProcessRunner.RunStreaming(start,3600,output,null,options.Mode=="launch");if(result.ExitCode!=0){string detail=friendlyError??result.Error;if(detail.Length>1500)detail=detail.Substring(0,1500);throw new Exception(detail.Length>0?detail:"Setup could not finish. Check internet access and disk space, then retry.");}
  if(outcome==null)throw new Exception("Setup did not report a known result. Inspect the installation before retrying.");return outcome;
 }
}
internal sealed class SetupForm:Form {
 readonly Options options;readonly Label heading=new Label(),description=new Label(),status=new Label();readonly Button primary=new Button(),secondary=new Button();readonly CheckBox autostart=new CheckBox();readonly ProgressBar progress=new ProgressBar();bool working,completed;string next="install";
 public SetupForm(Options value){options=value;Text="Relay Setup · Beta";ClientSize=new Size(560,440);MinimumSize=new Size(520,430);StartPosition=FormStartPosition.CenterScreen;Font=new Font("Segoe UI",10);BackColor=Color.FromArgb(247,245,239);ForeColor=Color.FromArgb(35,51,47);FormBorderStyle=FormBorderStyle.FixedDialog;MaximizeBox=false;
  var brand=new Label{Text="Relay",Font=new Font("Segoe UI",18,FontStyle.Bold),Location=new Point(32,25),Size=new Size(460,40)};Controls.Add(brand);heading.SetBounds(32,90,490,58);heading.Font=new Font("Segoe UI",22,FontStyle.Bold);description.SetBounds(34,157,480,84);status.SetBounds(34,250,480,55);status.AutoEllipsis=true;status.ForeColor=Color.FromArgb(85,102,96);autostart.SetBounds(34,310,470,28);autostart.Text="Start Relay when I sign in";autostart.Checked=options.AutoStart;progress.SetBounds(34,311,490,7);progress.Style=ProgressBarStyle.Marquee;progress.Visible=false;primary.SetBounds(310,359,214,46);primary.FlatStyle=FlatStyle.Flat;primary.BackColor=Color.FromArgb(49,112,94);primary.ForeColor=Color.White;primary.FlatAppearance.BorderSize=0;secondary.SetBounds(34,359,150,46);secondary.FlatStyle=FlatStyle.Flat;secondary.FlatAppearance.BorderSize=0;secondary.Text="Cancel";secondary.Click+=(s,e)=>Close();primary.Click+=async(s,e)=>await Act();Controls.AddRange(new Control[]{heading,description,status,autostart,progress,primary,secondary});AcceptButton=primary;CancelButton=secondary;
  if(options.Mode=="uninstall"){next="uninstall";heading.Text="Remove Relay?";description.Text="Application files will be removed. Your chats, agents and account data stay on this computer.";autostart.Visible=false;primary.Text="Uninstall Relay";}else{heading.Text="Your workspace, ready.";description.Text="Install Relay and its private runtime automatically. No terminals or separate dependency setup.";status.Text="First install needs internet, 5 GB free and a few minutes.\nWindows x64 beta · no administrator access needed.";primary.Text="Install Relay";}
  FormClosing+=(s,e)=>{if(working){e.Cancel=true;MessageBox.Show(this,"Setup is working. Wait for it to finish so the installation stays consistent.","Relay Setup",MessageBoxButtons.OK,MessageBoxIcon.Information);}};
 }
 async Task Act(){if(working)return;if(completed){options.Mode="launch";}else options.Mode=next;working=true;primary.Enabled=false;secondary.Enabled=false;autostart.Visible=false;progress.Visible=true;options.AutoStart=autostart.Checked;bool uncertain=false;var runner=new SetupRunner();runner.Progress+=message=>{if(!IsDisposed)BeginInvoke((Action)(()=>status.Text=message+"…"));};try{string outcome=await Task.Run(()=>runner.Run(options));if(outcome=="REMOVED"){heading.Text="Relay was removed.";description.Text="Your chats and account data have been kept.";status.Text="You can reinstall Relay later to use them again.";primary.Visible=false;secondary.Text="Close";}else if(outcome=="OPENED"){Program.OpenBrowser(options);CloseAfterWork();return;}else{completed=true;heading.Text=outcome=="EXISTING"?"Relay is already here.":"You’re ready.";description.Text=outcome=="EXISTING"?"Your current installation and data have been kept. Open Relay to continue.":"Open Relay, connect your accounts and start a conversation.";status.Text=runner.LastNotice.Length>0?runner.LastNotice:"Your files and accounts stay on this computer.";primary.Text="Open Relay";secondary.Text="Close";}}catch(Exception error){uncertain=error.Message.IndexOf("Unconfirmed setup cleanup",StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)>=0;heading.Text="Setup needs attention.";description.Text=uncertain?"Close setup and inspect existing effects before starting another installation.":"Your existing installation and account data were not replaced.";status.Text=error.Message.Length>350?error.Message.Substring(0,350):error.Message;primary.Text="Retry setup";completed=false;}finally{working=false;primary.Enabled=!uncertain;secondary.Enabled=true;progress.Visible=false;}}
 void CloseAfterWork(){working=false;Close();}
}
internal static class Program {
 public static void OpenBrowser(Options options){if(!options.NoBrowser)Process.Start(new ProcessStartInfo("http://127.0.0.1:"+options.Port+"/"){UseShellExecute=true});}
 [STAThread]static int Main(string[] args){Application.EnableVisualStyles();Application.SetCompatibleTextRenderingDefault(false);try{var options=Options.Parse(args);options.LoadInstalledSettings();if(Array.IndexOf(args,"--uninstall")>=0&&Path.GetFileName(Path.GetDirectoryName(Application.ExecutablePath)).Equals(".runtime",StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)){string folder=Path.Combine(Environment.GetFolderPath(Environment.SpecialFolder.LocalApplicationData),"Temp","RelayUninstall-"+Guid.NewGuid().ToString("N"));Directory.CreateDirectory(folder);string copy=Path.Combine(folder,"RelaySetup.exe");File.Copy(Application.ExecutablePath,copy);var command="--uninstall-worker --destination "+SetupRunner.Quote(options.Destination)+" --data "+SetupRunner.Quote(options.Data)+" --port "+options.Port+(options.NoIntegrations?" --no-integrations":"")+(options.Silent?" --silent":"");Process.Start(new ProcessStartInfo(copy,command){UseShellExecute=false});return 0;}
  if(options.Silent||options.Mode=="launch"){var runner=new SetupRunner();try{string result=runner.Run(options);if(options.Silent)File.WriteAllText(Path.Combine(Environment.GetFolderPath(Environment.SpecialFolder.LocalApplicationData),"Temp","RelaySetup-last-result.txt"),result);if(options.Mode=="launch")OpenBrowser(options);return 0;}catch(Exception error){if(options.Silent)File.WriteAllText(Path.Combine(Environment.GetFolderPath(Environment.SpecialFolder.LocalApplicationData),"Temp","RelaySetup-last-error.txt"),error.Message);else MessageBox.Show(error.Message,"Relay needs attention",MessageBoxButtons.OK,MessageBoxIcon.Error);return 1;}}
  Application.Run(new SetupForm(options));return 0;}catch(Exception error){MessageBox.Show(error.Message,"Relay Setup",MessageBoxButtons.OK,MessageBoxIcon.Error);return 1;}}
}
